# AI Service Standards (Python + FastAPI)

Responsibilities: LLM, embeddings, memory retrieval, planning, prompts, tool calling.

- Never perform database operations from the AI service.
- All persistence goes through `services/api` HTTP APIs.
- AI decides which tools to invoke; API executes and returns results.
- Keep prompts versioned and explicit. Prefer structured tool schemas.
- Stream responses when the API/web path supports it.
- Structured logging. Never swallow exceptions.
- Do not put product CRUD rules in prompts — encode them in API services.
